-- ============================================================================
-- seed_demo_household.sql — Plan 85
-- Populate a PRIVATE demo household in PROD with realistic "Familjen Lundqvist"
-- data, so the app can be demoed fully-populated without touching or exposing
-- the owner's real household.
--
-- ⚠ THIS IS NOT A MIGRATION. It must never live in supabase/migrations/, never
--   run in CI, and never run on `supabase db reset`. It is a manual, prod-only,
--   one-off, executed by the owner from an interactive shell against the linked
--   prod project. (See supabase/demo/README.md for the full runbook.)
--
-- GUARDRAILS
--   • Every statement below is scoped to a single household via the :HID psql
--     variable — there is NO bare INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE that could touch another
--     household. :HID must point at a household created FOR the demo (step 1 of
--     the runbook), never the real one.
--   • CONFIRM THE TARGET before running anything:
--         select current_database(), inet_server_addr();
--     and verify you are on the linked PROD project, not local.
--   • The rows were captured by driving the real app against the isolated local
--     Supabase (plan 83) so every jsonb blob (tool_state, scenarios, monthend)
--     is shape-correct by construction — do not hand-edit the blobs.
--   • Loads are INSERTs (not upserts): a PK collision fails LOUD rather than
--     clobbering an existing prod row. Text PKs are Date.now()-derived and
--     globally unique; uuid PKs are random.
--
-- USAGE (psql — supports the :'HID' variable):
--     \set HID '…the demo household uuid from runbook step 1…'
--     \i supabase/demo/seed_demo_household.sql
--   or:  psql "$PROD_URL" -v HID='…uuid…' -f supabase/demo/seed_demo_household.sql
--   (The Supabase dashboard SQL editor does NOT support psql variables — if you
--    must use it, find-replace :'HID' with the quoted uuid first.)
--
-- WHAT THIS LOADS (all scoped to :HID):
--   mortgage_loan_parts ×2  · mortgage_valuations ×2 (one is_purchase)
--   mortgage_payments ×48 (a year of interest+amortisation across both parts)
--   scenarios ×1 (Bostadskalkyl "Radhus i Bromma")
--   tool_state ×3 (Konsultkalkyl, Löneväxling, Hushållsbudget blobs)
--   monthend_items ×2 + monthend_payments ×1 (one settled month)
--   NOT loaded: mortgage_rate_periods / mortgage_contributions /
--   salary_submissions — the app renders the demo fully without them
--   (kontantinsats is derived from purchase − original loan; Löneväxling state
--   lives in tool_state, not salary_submissions).
--
-- REVERSAL (removes every demo artefact; run to undo this seed — households /
-- household_invites / household_members rows come from the runbook, not here):
--     delete from public.monthend_payments      where household_id = :'HID';
--     delete from public.monthend_items          where household_id = :'HID';
--     delete from public.mortgage_payments       where household_id = :'HID';
--     delete from public.mortgage_valuations     where household_id = :'HID';
--     delete from public.mortgage_loan_parts     where household_id = :'HID';
--     delete from public.scenarios               where household_id = :'HID';
--     delete from public.tool_state              where household_id = :'HID';
--   (then the runbook's household_members / household_invites / households
--    deletes, in that order, to fully remove the demo household.)
-- ============================================================================

\if :{?HID}
\else
  \echo '>>> ERROR: :HID is not set. Set it first:  \set HID ''<demo-household-uuid>'''
  \quit
\endif

begin;

